{"reviews":[{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-0","r":5.0,"t":"PICC line cover!","x":"I bought these to cover my PICC line and they worked awesome! Light and breathable as well as fun! I did have nurses and doctors comment on my tattoos! Lmao until I pulled them down for infusions.\ud83d\ude01 hey! If you have to a PICC may aswell make it interesting!","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-1","r":3.0,"t":"not quite long enough","x":"i'm 6'2\" and have 35\" arms, these do not quite go from wrist to bicep, almost a little above the elbow. So if you have short Arms, they may work well. i did receive 13 pieces, each one a Separate design, so nothing Matches as a pair!","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-2","r":5.0,"t":"Great fit","x":"I use these tattoo arm sleeves to wear while riding my Motorcycle. They fit really well and I received a lot of comments about wearing them.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-3","r":5.0,"t":"Fun protection","x":"I purchased these for my 80 year old mother. She has always wanted a tattoo but afraid to get one. Her skin like us all as we age has become thin and damages easy. Plus she has always had sun issues. Wearing these keeps her protected from the sun, has helped protect her skin from injuries and she totally looks rad with her cool tattoos. She loves them!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-4","r":4.0,"t":"Great For Yard & Garden","x":"We use these more than we thought we would. Any briars or trimming branches. Better than all the nicks & scratches. Nice to work in a T-shirt. These stay cool in hot weather. They are not incredibly durable. A few uses and snags and they start to unraveling a few threads.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-5","r":4.0,"t":"Great For Yard & Garden","x":"We use these more than we thought we would. Any briars or trimming branches. Better than all the nicks & scratches. Nice to work in a T-shirt. These stay cool in hot weather. They are not incredibly durable. A few uses and snags and they start to unraveling a few threads.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-6","r":2.0,"t":"THE SLEEVE IS NOT SHEER","x":"EASY TO SEE UR WEARING A STOCKING W/ TATS ON IT 2 STARS FOR TATS BUT REALLY EXPECTED SHEER MATERIAL SO U HAD TO BE  RIGHT UP ON THEM TO TELL","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-7","r":3.0,"t":"These are singles, not pairs","x":"I thought these would be matching pairs. If you want sets, you will have to order two. They are thin, like pantyhose. Images are good quality. Disapointed about the sets.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-8","r":5.0,"t":"Comfortable","x":"Easy to use and very comfortable. Wish they were longer.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-9","r":5.0,"t":"These are pretty great.","x":"I bought these as an alternative to long sleeves to hide some burns but I had on my arms. A lot of people have mistaking them for tattoo sleeves. So it did what I wanted her to do and it was kind of fun. I just ordered another pack. They last for a while you know you could probably get a weeks where out of one slave all told. Attend a stretch Autin become more difficult to wear as time goes on. But I guess it depends on what you\u2019re looking for.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-10","r":5.0,"t":"Tattoo Sleeves make people do a double take. \ud83d\ude40","x":"These are great fun. People double take - especially those  that know me.  Guy in a car on the freeway was honking and giving me the high five for the ink sleeves at a distance he thought were real.  \ud83d\ude02 i wear them with short sleeved  shirts in the cool mornings and take them off as it gets warmer. Great fall accessory.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-11","r":2.0,"t":"Poor printing and material .","x":"They do fit my arm but the patterns are not very good and these won't fool anyone into thinking they are real tattoos. They do not fade into skin tones and look fake, even from a distance. I tried all 12 of these and they just look cheap. I am returning them.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-12","r":2.0,"t":"They are junk!","x":"They are too dark and to short! the material  is hot and sweaty.... uncomfortable.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-13","r":1.0,"t":"Bs","x":"Man I thought I was gonna like these to add a little character to my style. Turns out unot only are they cheaply made but they are also  waaaay too short. I\u2019m an average size guy, maybe even a bit on the smaller size; I am tall, however, my arms are not gigantic, long, can reach anything across the room arms, just to give you an idea. While wearing a short sleeve shirt, the top of the sleeve shows my skin.  It just keeps sliding down. No matter how much I stretch and pull up; by time I\u2019m moving ","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-14","r":5.0,"t":"Fun product, well made!","x":"I bought these for Halloween.  The tattoo sleeves were a big hit!!  The designs are great, with a nice variety to choose from.  Everyone asked me where I found them!  The sleeves fit me well and very comfortable to wear, but the sleeves may not fit a larger person.  I am 5'6\" about 150 pounds.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-15","r":3.0,"t":"Look great but don\u2019t stay up","x":"Maybe my arms are too skinny or something but these don\u2019t stay up. The material is thin. If you are going to where them for only 30 minutes they may be ok but I need them to stay in place all day.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-16","r":3.0,"t":"Durability lacking","x":"One of the sleeves started to rip after using only twice. If you're looking for something that's going to last, these probably aren't it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-17","r":3.0,"t":"Fabric is not the best quality to block the Sun or to act as a Sunscreen Arm Sleeves.","x":"Fabric is not the best quality to block the Sun or to act as a Sunscreen Arm Sleeves. Stitching is flimsy. Did not meet my expectations.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-18","r":3.0,"t":"Not pleased","x":"They are not long enough for me. I am 6 1 and with the same size measurement fingertips as I am tall.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-19","r":4.0,"t":"A comfortable stylish addition to my wardrobe","x":"They came so fast and they are so comfortable, I will be ordering more here in the near future.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-20","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect gift for the ink shy.","x":"Got these to help cover up senior bruising on arms. Work perfectly. Spark conversation.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-21","r":4.0,"t":"Design tattoo arm sleevs","x":"I love my design tatoo arm sleevs they're comfortable and soft","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2023"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-22","r":5.0,"t":"Protect your arms","x":"Bought these for my husband who is a commercial fisherman who clams and scallops and he uses these to protect his arms while picking at the belt. They work awesome so he can work without getting cut up","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-23","r":5.0,"t":"These were great for my friend","x":"I live in Arizona and when you work outside you have to wear long sleeves, so now instead of wearing a heavy long sleeve shirt he can wear a t shirt with them and be out in the sun","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B0C58XKGCS-24","r":2.0,"t":"Nice but small","x":"The designs on the sleeves look great but the sleeves were to small. The person I purchased them for just open the package and found out they were too small.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the sleeves fun and effective at fooling people into thinking they are real tattoos, often drawing comments and double takes.","cites":[1,3,10,11,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the sleeves are too short, especially for taller or longer-armed people.","cites":[2,9,13,14]},{"text":"Reviewers commonly note the sleeves are thin and not very durable, with some saying they look cheap or fake.","cites":[5,6,8,12,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers were disappointed that the sleeves come as singles with mismatched designs rather than matching pairs.","cites":[2,8]},{"text":"Reviewers report using the sleeves for practical protection, such as sun protection, yard work, and covering burns or PICC lines.","cites":[1,4,5,6,10]}]},"qa":[]}